  },
  {
   "text": "The catalog here only has two seed entries (Block id 1, Spike id 8) \u2014 it has no portal ids at all, so I won't invent any. Instead I'll build with GridText, whose built-in characters (`W` wave, `C` cube, `#`, `^`) place the game's real objects.\n\nLet me draft the section and verify it before committing.",
   "tool_calls": [
    {
     "id": "call_00_fW93mudmYB3LhyORvtyL5258",
     "name": "place_grid",
     "arguments": {
      "grid": "@grid col=10 row=0 w=41 h=6\n.#######################################.\n...........#...........#..........#..###.\n.....................................###.\n.........................................\nW.......................................C\n.....^...........^...........^...........",
      "verify": {
       "gamemode": "cube",
       "speed": "1x",
       "entry_row": 0
      },
      "preview": true
     }
    }
   ],
   "stop_reason": "tool_use",
   "usage": {
    "input_tokens": 13696,
    "output_tokens": 7087
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Verification says it's beatable, but the tightest press window is 12.5 ms \u2014 that's a hard input, not an easy one. Let me open it up: fewer obstacles, wider spacing.",
