    "output_tokens": 5248
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Better (20\u201325 ms), but still short of an easy window. The problem is the wave enters near the ground, so clearing ground-level spikes is a low-margin move. Let me instead use raised platforms and ceiling blocks, so the wave flies through a mid-height band with room either side.",
   "tool_calls": [
    {
     "id": "call_00_qKdwzxKuDrbQYtkpIIbj6991",
     "name": "place_grid",
     "arguments": {
      "grid": "@grid col=10 row=0 w=41 h=6\n.#######################################.\n.............#.............#.........###.\n.....................................###.\n.........................................\nW.....^.............^...................C\n......#.............#....................",
      "preview": true,
