    "input_tokens": 29353,
    "output_tokens": 6226
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Progress (25/37.5 ms), but still short of easy. The binding constraint is the ceiling being close to the required path. Let me give the section a taller flying band and a clean funnel into the cube portal.",
